# what: the seccomp profile no longer allows pivot_root, which Docker's default
#       profile refuses to every container. The image, the AppArmor profile and
#       sandbox.sh's flags are unchanged; only the syscall bubblewrap needs to
#       switch to its new root is refused again. This is the profile a narrowing
#       one syscall too far would ship.
