#       Expected: assertions 1 and 2 PASS (the image is unchanged), and assertions 3
#       and 4 FAIL — bubblewrap stops at `pivot_root: Operation not permitted`. That
#       the case catches it is what makes the profile's five additions checked
#       rather than merely present; a patch that broke the image instead would fail
#       it at 1 or 2 and demonstrate nothing about the profile.
